---
title: block_construction (Osaka blocks.py)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_init
    q_init --> q_set_header : header = Header
    q_set_header --> q_set_transactions : transactions = Tuple[Bytes | LegacyTransaction, ...]
    q_set_transactions --> q_set_ommers : ommers = Tuple[Header, ...]
    q_set_ommers --> q_set_withdrawals : withdrawals = Tuple[Withdrawal, ...]
    q_set_withdrawals --> q_final : freeze(Block)
    q_final --> [*]

    note right of q_final
        INV: Block is immutable (slotted_freezable)
    end note

    note right of q_set_ommers
        INV: ommers tuple is always empty in PoS forks
    end note

    note right of q_set_transactions
        INV: header.transactions_root commits
        to the transactions tuple
    end note

    note right of q_set_withdrawals
        INV: header.withdrawals_root commits
        to the withdrawals tuple
    end note
